      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know. everything feels so... pointless. it's like i'm just watching a movie of my life instead of living it. and the worst part is knowing there's nothing left to look forward to. just more of this. more of the quiet and the waiting. it feels like a burden to even exist at this point.",
